        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Alice's Birthday, Eleanor's Secret\n- People: Sergey Seryogin, Dominique Monféry\n- Companies: Master-film studio\n- Topics: Animated films, children's science fiction films, Franco-Italian films, Russian films\n\nFacts:\n- Alice's Birthday is a 2009 Russian traditionally animated children's science fiction film.\n- Alice's Birthday is also known by the Russian title Де́нь рожде́ния Али́сы and the transliteration Den' rozhdeniya Alisy.\n- Alice's Birthday was directed by Sergey Seryogin and produced by Master-film studio.\n- Eleanor's Secret is a 2009 Franco-Italian animated feature film.\n- Eleanor's Secret has the original French title Kérity, la maison des contes.\n- Eleanor's Secret was directed by Dominique Monféry.",
